  "prefLabel": "Ins 1905.21 Filing Requirement for Advertising",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1905.21 Filing Requirement for Advertising. An issuer shall provide a copy of any Medicare supplement advertisement intended for use in this state whether through written, radio or television medium to the commissioner of insurance of this state for review or approval by the commissioner to the extent it may be required under state law.\n\nSource. #5390, eff 7-1-92; ss by #5656, eff 7-1-93; ss by #6406, eff 1-1-97; ss by #7174, eff 12-22-99; ss by #8051, eff 3-1-04; ss by #8363, eff 9-8-05; ss by #9559, eff 10-13-09 (from Ins 1905.18); ss by #12370, eff 10-13-17 (from Ins 1905.20)",
